  (text "2.5G switch RTL8372N + SPI flash (board A, beside the 4 NICs)"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "393396a3-1bdb-57ab-9980-87a1f87374c9"))
  (text "Switch ports P0-P3 = USB-C ports 1-4 (PHY-to-PHY to each RTL8156BG). S0 -> router SerDes (LAN). S1 -> RTL8221B -> RJ45 (WAN, PoE in)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 23.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "67e49714-3bb7-5cf5-8b67-4e322569f5c0"))
  (text "Management: the router owns the switch (DSA) over SMDC/SMDIO (through the router-domain isolation FETs on board B); switch MDC0/MDIO0 manages the RTL8221B. SDK firmware in SPI flash."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "7e2c3339-069f-5d6d-9130-8d5b054d2154"))
  (text "X-29 reset: ETH_SW_RST_N = TPS3808G33(V3V3_SW, MR=EXP_SW_RST_N) AND TPS3808G01(V0V95_SWA). Release 126 ms typ / 68 ms min after the LAST rail is valid (needs >= 10.5 ms). Expander-initiated resets are also stretched to >= 68 ms (t6 >= 10.5 ms)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 30.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "f21fe3e0-f8e2-51d3-9db5-2f2e1ab01bec"))
  (text "X-28 first boot: OPEN - the RTL8372N image is the Realtek SDK build (NDA). No image is in this repository and no blank-flash host-init mode is verified. Bring-up: EXP_EN_ETH=1, EXP_SW_RST_N=0 (or hold J pin 7 low), program U(flash) through the 2x4 ISP header, read back, then release reset."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20 34 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left))
